f%20the%20tree%20that%20goes%20on%20past%20the%20span%2C%20as%20the%0A%20%2A%20items%20a%20parser%20has%20in%20progress%20there.%20A%20chain%20through%20a%20call%20that%20began%20no%0A%20%2A%20such%20node%20lexed%20the%20text%20before%20the%20span%20otherwise%20%28Rust%27s%20%60m%21%28%27%22%27%29%60%2C%20whose%0A%20%2A%20token%20tree%20also%20takes%20%60%27%60%20alone%20and%20a%20string%20to%20the%20next%20%60%22%60%2C%20where%20a%20later%0A%20%2A%20%60_%60%20type%20is%20a%20keyword%20%60_%60%20token%29%3A%20the%20tree%27s%20parse%20never%20reached%20that%20state.%0A%20%2A%20A%20call%27s%20result%20is%20shared%20by%20every%20call%20that%20made%20it%2C%20so%20every%20chain%20counts.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20An%20immediate%20token%20a%20literal%20%28%60%28immediateToken%20%28literal%20%5B%29%29%60%29%20outranks%20the%0A%20%2A%20plain%20literal%20of%20the%20same%20text%2C%20which%20a%20lexer%20so%20lexes%20only%20where%20no%0A%20%2A%20immediate%20one%20is%20valid%20%28Lean%27s%20%60foo%5B1%3A2%3A3%5D%60%2C%20whose%20%60%5B%60%20opens%20a%20subscript%2C%0A%20%2A%20not%20a%20range%20applied%20to%20%60foo%60%29%3A%20the%20spans%20where%20an%20immediate%20literal%20matched%0A%20%2A%20%28%60matchedImmediate%60%29%20become%20immediate-only%20%28%60immediates%60%29%20alike%20where%20the%0A%20%2A%20tree%20took%20the%20plain%20literal%20%28a%20%60plain%60%20leaf%29%2C%20whose%20parse%20state%20the%0A%20%2A%20immediate%20one%20matched%20in.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20An%20immediate%20token%20that%20matched%20separator%20text%20alone%20at%20an%20offset%0A%20%2A%20%28%60matchedSeparators%60%2C%20Make%27s%20line%20break%20that%20ends%20a%20rule%29%20is%20lexed%20there%0A%20%2A%20where%20the%20tree%20skipped%20a%20separator%20in%20its%20parse%20state%3A%20a%20tree-sitter%20lexer%0A%20%2A%20that%20completed%20it%20takes%20no%20separator%20transition%20after%20it%2C%20so%20the%20offset%0A%20%2A%20skips%20no%20separator%20%28%60separators%60%29%20when%20the%20input%20is%20parsed%20again%20%28Make